{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object is near, take it, check its properties, perform task. Otherwise, approach object or explore.     list of available nodes: <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectWeight    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectTexture    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectColor    /> <Action ID = PerformTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectPosition    /> <Action ID = ExploreArea    />",
